luscdn.com&oh=00_Afsq1u1SIEIgrJ8zfZ9KM0FWrISUObR4VyAMIwZEc_aJKg&oe=699F05DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440.png", "id": "284612080076581", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974910_284612083409914_181064660682537571_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EtMOOCpVK1oQ7kNvwGx65F8&_nc_oc=AdnbIAzSWRif78KSVPATUGdRSTKKjd6hkKaxTAzI3HPBl6ECIdmrr3vA8AnBp177B9w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftg98laERiLj7SrdcpH5f_A44GGqRYRHekeD7XYt1Xh2A&oe=699ED474"}, "display_name": "Wack-Ammo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "You are armed with a Wack-A-Mole game and a gun to eliminate your targets in each new gallery.  The trick is, you must keep playing Wack-A-Mole to keep your gun loaded.  \n\nEach level ups the challenge and keeps you on your toes.  Take your eyes of the board and it could end it all.  \n\nWack-Ammo is a fun throwback to the old light gun games of the 8 bit era. The hand drawn 2D graphics put you inside these classic shooters with the added flare of VR.\n\n* 9 Unique Levels \n* Different Guns & Wackers Each Gallery\n* Unlock Badges For Your \"Wall Of Achievement\" With Each Victory\n*Earned Trophies Come To Life In Your Home Gallery\n\nWack-Ammo is a must play for every Quest owner.", "short_description": "You are armed with a Wack-A-Mole game and a gun to eliminate your targets in each new gallery.  The trick is, you must keep playing Wack-A-Mole to keep your gun loaded.  \n\nEach level ups the challenge and keeps you on your toes.  Take your eyes of the board and it could end it all.  \n\nWack-Ammo is a fun throwback to the old light gun games of the 8 bit era. The hand drawn 2D graphics put you inside these classic shooters with the added flare of VR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://johnray32875.wixsite.com/johnraygames/wackammo", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "John Ray Games", "support_websit